    "title": "Dancing with the Stars returns - NewsBreak",
    "text": "thecrossroads.news\nwebsite\nEmanuel County, Georgia\nDancing with the Stars returns\nBy thecrossroadsnews,\n19 hours agoJoin as members of our very own community take the stage for the 2nd Annual Dancing with the Stars in hopes of raising money for The Sunshine House Child Advocacy Center. The event will be held Saturday, August 9, at 2 p.m. and 6 p.m. at the Emanuel County Auditorium. Tickets will be $15 for students and $25 for adults.",
